<title>USA: GF Bancorp FY 1997 shr lower.</title>
<headline>GF Bancorp FY 1997 shr lower.</headline>
<dateline>GERMANTOWN, Ohio 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.67		    $1.24</p>
<p> Net			    197			371</p>
<p> Net interest	     1,799		    1,708</p>
<p> Loan loss prov	   1,766		    1,708</p>
<p> Avg shrs		     292			299</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full company name is GF Bancorp Inc, holding company for Germantown Federal Savings Bank.</p>
<p>1997 net income included a one-time charge on September 30, 1996 of $269,558 ($177,897 after tax or $0.61 a share) to provide for an assessment to recapitalize the Savings Association Insurance Fund.</p>
<p>Its stock is not traded on any exchange. It is traded in the over-the-counter market and listed in the &quot;pink sheets&quot;.</p>
